      "text": "Zoram1 makes oath to tarry with family of Lehi1, 1 Ne. 4:35. Lehi1 tarried in wilderness, 1 Ne. 8:2. priests of Noah3 tarried in wilderness, Mosiah 20:4. multitude ask Jesus to tarry a little longer, 3 Ne. 17:5. Three Nephites allowed to tarry until Christ’s coming, 3 Ne. 28:4–12 (4 Ne. 1:14, 30, 37; Morm. 8:10; 9:22).",
